      "value": "Came here with the same idea- would be wonderful to mass integrate an entire folder's worth of projects instead of doing it one at a time. A lot of older Creators likely have hundreds of folders and files, so it would make it less time-consuming to migrate an entire folder than to do it one at a time. \n\nHere's hoping this gets noticed!",
